sequenceDiagram
  participant S as Staff
  participant UI as OrderDetailModal
  participant X as "orders.updateStatus"
  participant F as orderStatusFlow

  S->>UI: Open order (pending)
  UI->>UI: allowedOrderStatusActions to Accept, Cancel
  S->>UI: Accept
  UI->>X: status confirmed
  X->>F: assertValidStatusTransition
  F-->>X: OK
  X->>X: patch orders

  S->>UI: Cancel (from preparing)
  UI->>UI: Prompt cancellationReason
  UI->>X: status cancelled + reason
  X->>F: assert + require reason
  X->>X: patch orders.cancellationReason

  Note over S,X: Cannot set pending after confirmed
